audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: Which environment variable should skills use to locate the plugin, and why?

Records that skills use only ENGSYS_PLUGIN_ROOT exported by the `engsys claude` launcher, while CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is reserved for hook commands.
Translated from Korean to English; frontmatter, variable names, `/bin/engsys`, tests/test-launcher.sh and the five-skill count are unchanged.
Headings mapped to Context, Decision, Alternatives and Consequences; lead paragraph kept before the first section.
"lock으로 revision을 고정" rendered as pinning the revision with the lock, matching the locked-revision terminology.
The revisit condition (Claude Code exposing the plugin path to skills) is preserved. No Korean literals retained.

